# Vite / bun build artifacts
node_modules
bun.lockb.bak

# TypeScript incremental-compilation cache (CodeRabbit #116). These
# are machine-specific build metadata, regenerated by `tsc -b` on
# every run — `dist/` is the publishable artifact, `.tsbuildinfo` is
# private to the local checkout.
*.tsbuildinfo

# The Vite-built SPA bundle is intentionally NOT ignored — rust-embed
# bakes dist/ into kanade-backend.exe at compile time, and we need it
# present on every cargo build / cargo publish. CI / `cargo make
# web-build` regenerates it before committing.

# Editor / OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
